  "description": "Turns a constrained JSON SELECT message into a validated SqlKata query over one backend-owned table or view, so AI tools and other remote callers can request data without sending SQL. Independent community package; not affiliated with the SqlKata project.",
  "id": "SqlKata.JsonQuery",
